1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,960
=Episode 9=

4
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,760
My eldest daughter

5
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:01,959
has always been levelheaded.

6
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:05,159
I'll save
this Hotan jade Guanyin of Fertility

7
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,719
as a precious dowry piece for her.

8
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,439
May it bless her with children
soon after marriage.

9
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,360
My second daughter loves dressing up.

10
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,960
This set of pure-gold hair ornaments

11
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,439
will suit her perfectly.

12
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,439
As for my third daughter,

13
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,240
it's too early to prepare her dowry.

14
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,199
I'll save this bolt of brocade

15
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,599
for her.

16
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:30,879
When she comes of age,

17
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:31,800
I'll have her measured

18
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,599
and make her a dress.

19
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:35,919
She'll outshine every girl there.

20
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:38,599
The dowries you've prepared, Madam,

21
00:02:38,599 --> 00:02:39,919
are already more than generous.

22
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:42,879
Enough to set all three girls up
for life.

23
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:44,560
Money...

24
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:45,919
I can't guarantee it'll last.

25
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,560
But at least

26
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:51,240
I can leave them something
they can hold on to.

27
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:54,599
Something they can keep close,

28
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,199
and close to their hearts.

29
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,680
Something to rely on and pass down,

30
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,639
something that stays with them for life.

31
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:12,000
(Cuifu Garden Poetry Gathering)

32
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:20,240
Huizhou ink. Chengxintang paper.

33
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:23,680
Miss Fan, you've made this
quite an elegant gathering.

34
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:26,199
How lovely to see the geese fly south,

35
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,960
while the great roc
soars across the vast skies.

36
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,639
The southbound goose

37
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:31,319
sets its sights afar.

38
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,840
And the soaring roc

39
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,919
rises straight to the heavens.

40
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:37,319
What better way to celebrate
Mr. Yu's success in the exams?

41
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,080
So this really is

42
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,960
a celebration for Mr. Yu.

43
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,280
Why not hold it at the Yu Residence?

44
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,479
Madam Yu said

45
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,879
we should keep things modest.

46
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,439
Besides,

47
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,800
they have a distant relative
staying with them,

48
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:53,840
so they can't entertain guests.

49
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,759
What distant relative?

50
00:03:58,639 --> 00:04:00,080
I don't know the details either.

51
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,599
Come, everyone. Please take a seat.

52
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,039
The autumn view is lovely,

53
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,240
but you must be tired.

54
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,759
- Please.
- Come on.

55
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,479
Let's sit down.

56
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,159
This way, please.

57
00:04:08,879 --> 00:04:09,639
Please, sit.

58
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,120
Have a seat.

59
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,840
It's such a beautiful day.

60
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,639
I've prepared some pastries for you.

61
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,079
Please, try them.

62
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:20,399
These pastries are unusual.

63
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,160
Madam sent these flower cakes
for Young Master.

64
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,439
They're quite rare.

65
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:26,680
I heard

66
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,160
they came all the way from the capital.

67
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,439
They're certainly hard to forget.

68
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:32,879
There we go.

69
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,279
They smell amazing.

70
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:39,519
Crisp and not too sweet.

71
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,800
I've tried every kind of pastry
you can imagine,

72
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,639
but nothing this good.

73
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:45,160
Even the shape

74
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,360
is so distinctive.

75
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,639
I think

76
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,680
I've had these before in the capital.

77
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:51,519
Good eye.

78
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,319
These flower cakes

79
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:55,079
can't be found anywhere in Yongning.

80
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:55,959
They simply aren't sold here.

81
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,759
Madam Yu couldn't attend

82
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,040
because she's busy at home,

83
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:01,639
so she had these specially sent

84
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,800
for all of you to enjoy.

85
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,600
Oh, please. They're not really for us.

86
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,680
I'd say

87
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,800
Madam Yu is simply doting
on you, Miss Fan,

88
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,079
letting her future daughter-in-law
have a taste of something special.

89
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,079
You always know how to tease me.

90
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,759
(Even the shape)

91
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:16,959
(is so distinctive.)

92
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,199
(I think)

93
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:20,240
(I've had these before in the capital.)

94
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,519
I think

95
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,959
I've had them too.

96
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:27,319
Had what, Madam?

97
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,279
The flower cakes.

98
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,839
At a palace banquet when my husband
returned to report on his post.

99
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,560
(They have a distant relative
staying with them,)

100
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,839
(so they can't entertain guests.)

101
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,279
(This is Miss Xie.)

102
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,920
(She's a close friend
of my future daughter-in-law.)

103
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,199
(Madam,)

104
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:43,360
(I'd like, on behalf of my fiance,
Mr. Zhao,)

105
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,800
(to ask for a salt permit.)

106
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:47,199
(She threw me over to chase
after an Imperial Envoy.)

107
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:49,199
(Mr. Zhao came to Huaying on business.)

108
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,639
(He falsely claimed
to be an Imperial Envoy.)

109
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:54,519
(Mr. Zhao wields immense power.)

110
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,959
(Once you miss,)

111
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,639
(there'll be no more chance.)

112
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,480
Quick!

113
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,199
Go get my husband. Now.

114
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,279
Yes, Madam.

115
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,360
(I've dealt with men sent from above)

116
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,800
(more times than I can count.)

117
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,800
(Western Capital Salt Transport Bureau)
(But this one is different.)

118
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,560
(He's from the imperial family.)

119
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,600
Jiuweijiao is such a big shot.

120
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,079
You did business with him

121
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,199
and didn't even tell me?

122
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:20,800
I...

123
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:23,079
I had no idea he was an informant.

124
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,800
Those two came through the Yu family,

125
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:27,120
and so did the flower cakes.

126
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,439
You see what's happening now?

127
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:30,000
I told you before,

128
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,279
with the heat on lately,

129
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:32,319
I need you to be vigilant.

130
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:34,079
Vigilant!

131
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,399
Fine.

132
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,000
If this blows up in our faces,

133
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,879
you and the three girls

134
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,319
are on your own.

135
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,120
Master,

136
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,199
I know I was wrong.

137
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:53,759
But we're in this together.

138
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:55,199
It's not too late to fix this.

139
00:06:55,199 --> 00:06:56,879
They can't have found anything on us.

140
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,000
They can't have, Master.

141
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:07,399
That's strange.

142
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,360
You're the one who extorted bribes
from salt merchants.

143
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:11,240
What's that got to do with me?

144
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,079
The Salt Transport Bureau

145
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,399
has always issued salt permits
by the book.

146
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:18,720
Every one of them is properly recorded.

147
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,839
Whatever you did on your own,

148
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,399
whatever gifts and bribes you took,

149
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,800
how would I know about any of it?

150
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,160
Besides,

151
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,639
did any of those things

152
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,920
ever

153
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,360
end up in my storeroom?

154
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,480
Weren't they all put down

155
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,360
as our daughters' dowries?

156
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,399
Yan,

157
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,000
you're really leaving me
to take the fall now?

158
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:39,800
All these years,

159
00:07:40,439 --> 00:07:42,079
I was your go-between,

160
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:44,240
cleaned up your messes
and collected your gold and silver.

161
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,279
Every coin that passed through my hands,

162
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:47,120
you handed over to your mistress.

163
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,120
Aside from these few things,

164
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:53,800
what did you ever leave
our daughters or me?

165
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:59,639
Did you ever actually see me
take your money

166
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:01,120
and give it to some mistress?

167
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:02,839
Can you prove it?

168
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,600
You...

169
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,759
We all have our lot in life.

170
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,839
If you could've given me a son,

171
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:08,759
I wouldn't have needed another woman.

172
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,879
Yan!

173
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:33,200
Give us a little more time, sir.

174
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,000
Once we know where things stand,

175
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,000
we can still turn this around.

176
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,000
It's too late.

177
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,080
Our cover's blown.

178
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,320
Madam Yan will never

179
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,440
do business with you again.

180
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,120
We'll have to move openly now,

181
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:45,919
arresting them first
and questioning them later.

182
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,879
By now, the books
may already be doctored.

183
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,159
We were careful every step of the way.

184
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,399
How did they figure us out?

185
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:54,000
His Highness isn't blaming you.

186
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:55,840
From here on,

187
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,279
leave it to us.

188
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,759
Don't give up just yet, sir.

189
00:09:00,399 --> 00:09:02,159
We've tipped them off,

190
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,720
but that may not be

191
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,759
a bad thing for us.

192
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,559
Madam Yan has done plenty of dirty work,

193
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:09,440
but to Lord Yan, she's still expendable.

194
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,720
She must be terrified right now.

195
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,840
Give her what she needs,

196
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,480
and we can turn her to our side.

197
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,799
How?

198
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,799
(Madam Yan took all those risks)

199
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,960
(for the sake of her three daughters.)

200
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:27,480
(That's where we start.)

201
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,240
(That gives us an opening.)

202
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:33,879
My Lady.

203
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,840
Look at this.

204
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,519
Isn't it pretty?

205
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:37,039
Who would've thought

206
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,519
the great Jiuweijiao

207
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:39,960
would become the court's lapdog?

208
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:42,440
Since you already know
who we really are,

209
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,519
you must know there's no escaping this.

210
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,879
The Crown Prince is investigating
the Yan family.

211
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:49,000
This isn't going to simply go away.

212
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,159
You have no evidence.

213
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,480
You think a few accusations

214
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,799
are enough to convict me?

215
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,879
That depends on what the Ministry
of Justice gets out of you.

216
00:09:55,639 --> 00:09:56,919
From what I hear,

217
00:09:56,919 --> 00:09:58,080
everyone confesses eventually.

218
00:09:58,559 --> 00:09:59,240
After all,

219
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,559
abusing official power
to sell salt permits for profit

220
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:02,639
not only

221
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:03,720
undermines the salt laws,

222
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:04,600
it also

223
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,600
harms the people.

224
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:06,639
By law,

225
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:08,799
it's a grave crime of treason.

226
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,399
A conviction means

227
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,440
ruin for your entire family.

228
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:13,320
And your three precious daughters

229
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,080
could be reduced to official courtesans.

230
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,279
Let me see!

231
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:18,679
Why'd you take mine?

232
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:20,559
My Lady!

233
00:10:20,559 --> 00:10:21,120
Give it back!

234
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,159
Come here!

235
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,480
No!

236
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,360
Give it to me!

237
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,559
Every mother

238
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,559
wants to protect her daughters.

239
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,039
I know

240
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,720
you don't want it to come to that.

241
00:10:34,399 --> 00:10:36,279
If you cooperate now,

242
00:10:36,639 --> 00:10:38,480
there's still a way to make amends.

243
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,759
Give us a sworn statement

244
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,799
implicating Lord Yan.

245
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,879
I'll ask the Crown Prince for mercy

246
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:47,279
and keep your three daughters
out of this.

247
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,360
You

248
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,759
lied to me once already.

249
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,960
Why should I trust you now?

250
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,519
Tell me.

251
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,799
If this all comes out,

252
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,720
what do you think Lord Yan will do?

253
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,200
He'll put

254
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,399
every last crime

255
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,240
squarely on you.

256
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:11,720
And then,

257
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:14,799
you may never get another chance

258
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,840
to save your three daughters.

259
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:25,799
Stop!

260
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,720
Don't run!

261
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,720
You can't see mine either!

262
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:29,840
Slow down!

263
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,360
Stop right there!

264
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,320
(Sworn Statement)

265
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,159
(Testimony of Madam Yan, nee Jiang)

266
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,960
(Since the thirteenth year of Dacheng,)

267
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,240
(I was coerced by my husband,)

268
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:44,840
(Commissioner of the Western Capital
Salt Transport Bureau,)

269
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,559
(Yan Shouzheng,)

270
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,240
(to sell salt permits illegally.)

271
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,159
(Details of all payments)

272
00:11:51,639 --> 00:11:52,840
(are recorded in the secret ledger.)

273
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,120
(The funds held in his mistress's name)

274
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,840
(all came
from illegal salt-permit sales.)

275
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:59,600
(Sworn Statement)
(I acknowledge my own guilt)

276
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:03,399
(and hereby name
the salt merchants involved.)

277
00:12:03,919 --> 00:12:05,600
(I humbly ask
that the principal offender be punished)

278
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,960
(to uphold the law.)

279
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,760
(Observe Goodness, Cultivate Virtue)

280
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,960
(Yongning Prefectural Yamen)

281
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,559
(Arrest Warrant)
We're here to search.

282
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:24,919
It's a mistake.

283
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,600
Officer, you must have got it wrong.

284
00:12:28,039 --> 00:12:29,120
We have

285
00:12:31,919 --> 00:12:33,159
a salt permit.

286
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,399
You've gone through a lot, gentlemen.

287
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,679
Save it.

288
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:39,600
That permit is exactly why we're here.

289
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,360
That gold ingot Madam Yan has...

290
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:42,840
You gave it to her, didn't you?

291
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,279
Orders from above.

292
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,000
All profits from the salt trade
are confiscated,

293
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,240
and you pay a fine.

294
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:50,519
Otherwise,

295
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,720
it's exile under the law.

296
00:12:53,559 --> 00:12:54,120
But...

297
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,919
I only just got that salt permit.

298
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,559
I haven't even made my money back.

299
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:02,440
How am I supposed to pay the fine?

300
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:05,440
If I can't raise the money,
we'll be exiled.

301
00:13:08,559 --> 00:13:09,279
Mr. Jin,

302
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:10,320
the truth is,

303
00:13:10,679 --> 00:13:12,200
that salt-permit business

304
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,759
wasn't really our doing.

305
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:20,480
When we left Huaying,

306
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:23,159
we swore to share

307
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:25,720
both fortune and misfortune.

308
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,080
Well,

309
00:13:26,279 --> 00:13:27,799
we've hardly had any fortune to share.

310
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,840
It's every man for himself.

311
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:31,519
You can't blame us for that.

312
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,799
Besides,

313
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,320
isn't that

314
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,840
exactly what you did to Mr. Zhao?

315
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,039
Exactly.

316
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,399
Try to understand.

317
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:48,440
Sorry.

318
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,880
(Yongning Prefectural Yamen)

319
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,879
Take all these salt merchants away.

320
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,679
Yes, sir.

321
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,360
Get up!

322
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:08,840
Move!

323
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,039
Go!

324
00:14:17,039 --> 00:14:17,720
General Mo.

325
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,320
What brings you here?

326
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,480
What's wrong?

327
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,440
Is there a man in here

328
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,960
named Jin Yuanbao?

329
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:29,360
Jin Yuanbao...

330
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,600
Let me check.

331
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:32,840
Yeah, we've got him.

332
00:14:33,879 --> 00:14:34,840
He won't pay the fine,

333
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,759
and no one's paid it for him.

334
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:36,720
He's waiting to be exiled.

335
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,039
Why?

336
00:14:39,679 --> 00:14:40,519
I'll pay it for him.

337
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,120
You?

338
00:14:43,279 --> 00:14:44,759
What's he to you?

339
00:14:45,039 --> 00:14:46,840
That's going to cost you a lot.

340
00:14:48,279 --> 00:14:49,559
Whatever it costs.

341
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,440
Back then...

342
00:14:54,799 --> 00:14:55,919
We were like brothers.

343
00:14:57,799 --> 00:14:59,039
Well, well.

344
00:14:59,399 --> 00:15:00,480
That's loyal of you.

345
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,120
I appreciate it, General.

346
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,919
Come on. I'll take you to see him.

347
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:06,639
Might as well see
what you're paying for.

348
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,559
All right.

349
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,000
Now that's a good man.

350
00:15:26,559 --> 00:15:27,720
Miss Xie,

351
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,559
thank you for doing this.

352
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,639
No need to thank me, Madam Yan.

353
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,480
There's still

354
00:15:34,759 --> 00:15:36,279
one thing I don't understand.

355
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:37,759
What is it?

356
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:39,000
That day,

357
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,840
did I give myself away somehow?

358
00:15:41,639 --> 00:15:43,759
Why did you suddenly pull out?

359
00:15:44,399 --> 00:15:45,360
It wasn't your mistake.

360
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:48,440
It was those flower cakes from Madam Yu.

361
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,360
You're clever, Miss Xie.

362
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,799
Too bad you're still a woman.

363
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:58,039
Since ancient times,

364
00:15:58,559 --> 00:15:59,919
a father's legacy passes to his son,

365
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,519
a brother's to his brother.

366
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,600
Never to a wife or daughter.

367
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:06,080
Just look at my three daughters.

368
00:16:06,759 --> 00:16:07,759
In the end,

369
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,960
everything I did for them
came to nothing.

370
00:16:10,639 --> 00:16:13,240
But why must a woman wait to inherit

371
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:15,240
what she could earn for herself?

372
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,679
There may be rules holding us back,

373
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,279
but rules can be broken.

374
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,320
All the more reason for a woman

375
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,120
to keep her wits about her.

376
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:25,159
Rather than waste her life
waiting for nothing,

377
00:16:25,519 --> 00:16:27,320
she can make her own way

378
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,120
and use her own abilities

379
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,559
to build a life for herself.

380
00:16:32,879 --> 00:16:34,159
You've got ambition.

381
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:36,679
But this world

382
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,000
has never lacked remarkable women.

383
00:16:40,159 --> 00:16:42,039
You could own countless mansions

384
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:43,159
and mountains of gold and silver,

385
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,759
but you couldn't keep them.

386
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:45,840
Why not?

387
00:16:46,639 --> 00:16:47,399
Let me ask you.

388
00:16:48,519 --> 00:16:50,159
When some thug eyes your wealth

389
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:52,080
and breaks in to take it,

390
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,279
what would you do?

391
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:56,240
I'd hire strong, capable men

392
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,840
to guard my home.

393
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:58,840
And what if one day

394
00:16:59,279 --> 00:17:00,720
you take a husband?

395
00:17:01,159 --> 00:17:03,000
Everything you've worked so hard for

396
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,559
becomes your dowry

397
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,279
and part of his family's property.

398
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,240
Then

399
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,759
what will you do?

400
00:17:09,759 --> 00:17:10,880
Then I simply won't marry.

401
00:17:11,039 --> 00:17:12,480
And what if someday

402
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:15,119
the men of the Fu family learn
you're still alive

403
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,759
and claim, in the family's name,

404
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:19,359
that everything you own belongs to them?

405
00:17:22,359 --> 00:17:23,759
That's the law.

406
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,839
It recognizes sons as the heirs.

407
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,480
In the end, you still need a man.

408
00:17:31,279 --> 00:17:33,200
Even if you choose carefully

409
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:35,559
and find someone like Zhao Ling,

410
00:17:36,279 --> 00:17:37,440
for the rest of your life,

411
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,720
you'll have to keep one eye on him.

412
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:40,640
Otherwise,

413
00:17:41,039 --> 00:17:42,200
you'll end up

414
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:44,279
exactly where I am today.

415
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,279
That is

416
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:48,920
a woman's lot.

417
00:17:51,519 --> 00:17:52,839
Thank you for the warning, Madam.

418
00:17:55,079 --> 00:17:56,559
You've trusted me with the truth.

419
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,400
I promise your daughters
will be protected.

420
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:00,720
You have my word.

421
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,799
(Miss Xie, you're a clever woman.)

422
00:18:17,759 --> 00:18:18,880
(So take this advice from me.)

423
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,119
(A woman)

424
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:23,720
(should never give anyone
her whole heart.)

425
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,119
(Only self-interest)

426
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:27,839
(will never betray you.)

427
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,359
How did it go?

428
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,559
Madam Yan pulled out at the last minute,

429
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,079
but it wasn't our mistake.

430
00:18:37,599 --> 00:18:39,240
The leak came from the Yu family.

431
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,799
That explains it.

432
00:18:57,839 --> 00:18:58,920
What are you up to now?

433
00:18:59,119 --> 00:19:00,079
Saving your life.

434
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,680
Cut it out.

435
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:02,799
Before,

436
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:04,759
all I cared about was money.

437
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:06,680
I trusted the wrong people

438
00:19:07,839 --> 00:19:08,759
and misjudged you.

439
00:19:08,839 --> 00:19:10,279
I don't owe you money anymore,

440
00:19:10,519 --> 00:19:11,519
and I don't owe you a favor.

441
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:13,400
So spare me the speech.

442
00:19:13,799 --> 00:19:14,920
If our paths cross again,

443
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,359
we'll owe each other nothing.

444
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:21,720
Zhao Ling!

445
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,119
I, Jin Yuanbao,

446
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,400
will always regard you as my brother!

447
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:37,279
Let this be my pledge.

448
00:19:37,839 --> 00:19:39,119
I'll never make the same mistake again!

449
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,759
(Yu Residence)

450
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:48,319
Jingxiu has two branches of the family
to carry on.

451
00:19:48,319 --> 00:19:49,759
His marriage is no small matter.

452
00:19:50,359 --> 00:19:51,680
Nothing can be left to chance.

453
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,119
On the guest list,

454
00:19:55,359 --> 00:19:57,119
every prominent family in Yongning,

455
00:19:57,359 --> 00:19:58,519
every friend and relative...

456
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,000
not one can be left out.

457
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,599
The wedding feast should run
for at least three days.

458
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:05,440
The first day for his fellow officials,

459
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:08,079
the second for friends and family,

460
00:20:08,079 --> 00:20:08,920
and the third

461
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,960
for the local folks.

462
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,079
Madam,

463
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:15,279
perhaps we could invite

464
00:20:16,319 --> 00:20:17,599
His Highness

465
00:20:18,039 --> 00:20:19,240
to the wedding banquet.

466
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:25,240
You've kept His Highness's investigation
at the separate courtyard

467
00:20:25,559 --> 00:20:27,319
completely secret until now.

468
00:20:27,559 --> 00:20:28,880
But the case is over,

469
00:20:29,359 --> 00:20:30,680
so there's no need to hide it anymore.

470
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,319
If we invite His Highness

471
00:20:33,519 --> 00:20:35,759
and Young Master gets even a few words
with him,

472
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,559
it could only help

473
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,200
with his future examinations.

474
00:20:46,319 --> 00:20:47,960
If you truly want to,

475
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,799
send over some wedding cakes.

476
00:20:50,319 --> 00:20:51,839
Whether His Highness attends or not,

477
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,839
receiving even a gift
from the royal household

478
00:20:54,119 --> 00:20:56,319
would be a great honor
for the Yu family.

479
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:57,640
Yes.

480
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,039
Madam,

481
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:01,079
an honored guest has arrived.

482
00:21:05,279 --> 00:21:06,720
Welcome, Your Highness.

483
00:21:07,279 --> 00:21:08,559
I'm afraid there's been
a misunderstanding, Madam.

484
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,000
His Highness is occupied elsewhere.

485
00:21:10,359 --> 00:21:11,319
He sent me

486
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,880
to escort a friend here.

487
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,640
Madam Yu.

488
00:21:22,119 --> 00:21:24,240
I hear there's
to be a wedding here soon.

489
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,240
You've shown me great kindness before,

490
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:28,039
so I've brought a wedding gift.

491
00:21:35,839 --> 00:21:38,279
Madam Yan saw those flower cakes

492
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,759
at Miss Fan's poetry gathering

493
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,640
and recognized them as something served
only in the palace.

494
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:46,119
It nearly compromised His Highness's
entire salt reform operation.

495
00:21:49,079 --> 00:21:50,440
Please believe me, Miss Xie.

496
00:21:51,119 --> 00:21:52,839
I truly knew nothing about this.

497
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,039
From now on,

498
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,839
I'll make sure it never happens again.

499
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,240
This can be taken one of two ways.

500
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,680
At best,

501
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,279
it was an innocent mistake,

502
00:22:05,559 --> 00:22:07,599
a failure to keep

503
00:22:07,599 --> 00:22:08,599
your household in line.

504
00:22:09,359 --> 00:22:11,640
The Sixteenth Master may let it go

505
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,599
for old times' sake.

506
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:16,319
But at worst...

507
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:18,039
Miss Xie, you are

508
00:22:18,039 --> 00:22:19,880
one of the Sixteenth Master's
most trusted people.

509
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:22,880
What do you want?

510
00:22:24,119 --> 00:22:25,640
You are clever, Madam.

511
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:30,920
Help me obtain one thing I want,

512
00:22:32,279 --> 00:22:33,359
and this matter

513
00:22:34,279 --> 00:22:36,079
will never be mentioned again.

514
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:43,160
When Zuo Junjie falsely accused me,

515
00:22:44,359 --> 00:22:45,559
his accusations were baseless,

516
00:22:45,559 --> 00:22:46,839
yet I had no way to defend myself

517
00:22:48,799 --> 00:22:51,039
because someone I trusted dearly

518
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,720
gave false testimony for him.

519
00:23:01,799 --> 00:23:02,480
Madam,

520
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,480
please...

521
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:11,960
Since you two old friends
have some catching up to do,

522
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,240
take her there.

523
00:23:28,119 --> 00:23:30,079
The Yu family needs something
from me now.

524
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,319
If you want to keep this marriage

525
00:23:32,519 --> 00:23:33,680
and preserve your dignity,

526
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,839
sign this written confession.

527
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:01,200
(Declarant: Fan Yake)

528
00:24:03,079 --> 00:24:05,359
On the night of the poetry gathering,

529
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:08,279
did Tingyun come to see you?

530
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,160
No.

531
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:13,560
(Signature of Declarant: Fan Yake)

532
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:20,160
Press your thumb.

533
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:27,960
Tingyun.

534
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:29,640
I'm begging you.

535
00:24:32,359 --> 00:24:33,559
Let me go this once.

536
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:38,279
Tingyun!

537
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,200
Tingyun!

538
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,279
Tingyun!

539
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:53,640
(Signature of Declarant: Fan Yake)

540
00:25:00,520 --> 00:25:02,519
(Written Confession)

541
00:25:02,519 --> 00:25:04,039
You must be feeling pretty pleased
with yourself.

542
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,880
From the very beginning,

543
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:09,599
you never thought
I was worth anything, did you?

544
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:11,839
People see

545
00:25:13,559 --> 00:25:15,000
what they already believe
in their hearts.

546
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:19,920
I never looked down on you.

547
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,359
You overthink everything

548
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:22,920
until you trap yourself
in your own suspicions.

549
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,799
When we were children,

550
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,839
we truly cared for each other.

551
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:29,599
That's why I never guarded myself
against you.

552
00:25:33,039 --> 00:25:33,839
Yake.

553
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,559
I bear some blame for this too.

554
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,400
I failed to understand

555
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,960
what you kept hidden inside,

556
00:25:42,559 --> 00:25:44,079
and that left you feeling wronged.

557
00:25:45,519 --> 00:25:47,799
Maybe we were never meant
to walk the same path.

558
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,599
Forcing ourselves to stay together

559
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:54,160
would only make us both miserable.

560
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:01,880
Fu Tingyun.

561
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:06,319
So you finally admit it.

562
00:26:06,559 --> 00:26:08,079
You're Huaying's model young lady,

563
00:26:09,359 --> 00:26:10,680
born into a fine family.

564
00:26:12,400 --> 00:26:13,400
And what am I?

565
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:16,599
I'll always be nothing but your shadow.

566
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:19,480
You were born a magnolia,

567
00:26:20,039 --> 00:26:21,200
so pure and above all others.

568
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,599
And me?

569
00:26:25,119 --> 00:26:27,000
I'm nothing but mud.

570
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,720
If I don't cling to something higher,

571
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,759
how else am I supposed

572
00:26:29,839 --> 00:26:31,440
to get ahead?

573
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,079
Maybe I was born a magnolia.

574
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:39,920
But that doesn't mean

575
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:42,000
I deserve to be plucked
and trampled underfoot.

576
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,759
And you've never stepped on anyone?

577
00:26:44,279 --> 00:26:46,079
Can you honestly say
you didn't use Madam Zuo

578
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,440
and her chastity memorial arch
to raise your own standing?

579
00:26:49,119 --> 00:26:50,200
And my father.

580
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:52,839
So what if he has students
throughout the land?

581
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:56,079
You still used him to land yourself
a wealthy husband.

582
00:26:56,359 --> 00:26:57,400
You're right.

583
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,200
And I've already paid the price for it.

584
00:27:01,599 --> 00:27:02,519
Now

585
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:06,319
it's your turn to pay

586
00:27:06,319 --> 00:27:07,279
for what you've done.

587
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:17,119
I stole your marriage from you.

588
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,799
Now you've gotten what you wanted

589
00:27:23,559 --> 00:27:25,359
and ruined mine in return.

590
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:28,319
I don't believe this marriage

591
00:27:28,319 --> 00:27:29,599
will take you anywhere higher.

592
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,720
We're

593
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,000
even now.

594
00:27:35,759 --> 00:27:37,039
I won't come after you again.

595
00:27:38,319 --> 00:27:40,160
You weren't the main culprit
in what happened at Huaying.

596
00:27:40,839 --> 00:27:42,759
Madam Zuo and her brother
were far worse.

597
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,599
You lost your way

598
00:27:45,799 --> 00:27:47,640
because Madam Zuo planted
the seeds of it.

599
00:27:48,279 --> 00:27:50,079
One day, I'll settle things with her too

600
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:53,039
and make her answer for what she caused.

601
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,079
Don't worry.

602
00:27:58,759 --> 00:28:00,440
Your marriage will still go ahead.

603
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:03,640
The Crown Prince has already seen
the wedding invitation.

604
00:28:04,039 --> 00:28:05,680
It's too late for the Yu family
to back out.

605
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:12,279
You slandered me

606
00:28:12,279 --> 00:28:13,599
in front of my future mother-in-law.

607
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,759
How can I ever have
a smooth path ahead?

608
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:24,080
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

609
00:28:25,079 --> 00:28:26,400
Even without me,

610
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,160
your days ahead

611
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,920
will never be smooth.

612
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:36,400
♪I enter this game without regret♪

613
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:39,040
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

614
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:43,480
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

615
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,680
The way Madam Yu looks at you

616
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,759
is exactly how my grandmother
looked at Madam Zuo.

617
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:51,960
Yake.

618
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,480
Take care of yourself.

619
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,279
Madam Zuo...

620
00:29:02,280 --> 00:29:08,000
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

621
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:10,960
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

622
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:16,080
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

623
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:21,600
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

624
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:23,680
Thank you, Madam.

625
00:29:24,319 --> 00:29:26,319
If you simply wanted to clear your name,

626
00:29:27,119 --> 00:29:28,880
you didn't need
to go to all this trouble.

627
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:30,559
You could have just asked me.

628
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:32,279
I wouldn't have refused.

629
00:29:34,839 --> 00:29:35,960
By doing this,

630
00:29:36,759 --> 00:29:39,359
you may have proven that Miss Fan
lacks virtue,

631
00:29:40,039 --> 00:29:41,240
but aren't you afraid

632
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,799
you've made yourself an enemy?

633
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,960
Even if I don't see you as an enemy,

634
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:48,359
does that mean you won't see me as one?

635
00:29:52,480 --> 00:29:54,920
I only wanted
to build a good life for myself.

636
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:57,759
But whenever I think
of what you've done,

637
00:29:58,039 --> 00:29:59,079
I can't feel at ease.

638
00:30:00,240 --> 00:30:02,319
I need something I can hold over you

639
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:05,000
to make sure that from now on,

640
00:30:05,759 --> 00:30:07,599
we stay out of each other's way.

641
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:13,079
So you weren't trying
to clear your name.

642
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:15,720
You wanted something
to protect yourself,

643
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:18,799
so no one
would dare push you around again.

644
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,200
Exactly.

645
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:22,519
But you're still on your own.

646
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:24,519
Once this is over,

647
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,680
where will you go?

648
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,240
Got the written confession?

649
00:30:39,519 --> 00:30:40,119
Yes.

650
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,839
My business is settled.

651
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:46,759
Now I'd like to ask about you.

652
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:48,480
Me?

653
00:30:49,039 --> 00:30:50,759
I'd like to offer some advice

654
00:30:50,839 --> 00:30:51,759
about what you should do next.

655
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:53,119
I'm listening.

656
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:00,240
Do you want to live rich for a while,

657
00:31:00,559 --> 00:31:01,960
or live in peace for good?

658
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:04,920
Right now,

659
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:06,880
everyone believes you are Jiuweijiao.

660
00:31:07,079 --> 00:31:08,559
By sheer luck,

661
00:31:08,759 --> 00:31:11,039
you've ended up at the top
of the salt-smuggling trade.

662
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,440
But what you don't see

663
00:31:12,559 --> 00:31:14,759
is that all that wealth
has put a target on your back.

664
00:31:15,039 --> 00:31:16,799
Especially with the Sixteenth Master
watching.

665
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:18,599
Once the salt case is closed,

666
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:21,480
even what you've done
to help may not save you.

667
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:23,079
You have a point.

668
00:31:23,559 --> 00:31:25,640
Instead of waiting for your enemies
to hunt you down

669
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,880
or the court to come after you,

670
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:30,240
turn over everything
that belongs to Jiuweijiao.

671
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:32,720
The Sixteenth Master may reward you

672
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:34,440
for what Zhao Ling has done.

673
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:36,200
That's something
you can actually build a life on.

674
00:31:43,480 --> 00:31:44,200
What about you?

675
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:46,839
What do you want?

676
00:31:48,279 --> 00:31:49,720
To tell the Sixteenth Master the truth,

677
00:31:50,599 --> 00:31:51,599
then return to the capital

678
00:31:52,359 --> 00:31:53,039
and find your mother?

679
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,440
The world's wide open to you now.

680
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,279
Take care of yourself.

681
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:12,480
Your Highness, I wish to surrender
all of Jiuweijiao's holdings.

682
00:32:12,839 --> 00:32:13,799
Please review the accounts.

683
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,640
These assets amount
to nearly one hundred thousand taels.

684
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:23,839
They can be used for disaster relief

685
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:25,920
to help those in immediate need.

686
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,720
Truly brave and strong in arms,

687
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:31,000
unyielding to the very end.

688
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,119
Today,

689
00:32:33,319 --> 00:32:34,599
I see you in a new light.

690
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:35,880
Zhao Ling.

691
00:32:36,039 --> 00:32:37,400
You rendered great service
in this investigation

692
00:32:37,519 --> 00:32:38,160
and deserve a reward.

693
00:32:38,519 --> 00:32:39,680
I've already decided.

694
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:40,720
For your reward,

695
00:32:40,799 --> 00:32:41,960
take my visiting card

696
00:32:42,039 --> 00:32:42,960
and join the army.

697
00:32:49,839 --> 00:32:51,480
I'm grateful for Your Highness's favor.

698
00:32:53,799 --> 00:32:55,200
But I have no desire to join the army.

699
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:57,160
I only want to be a salt merchant

700
00:32:57,720 --> 00:32:58,920
and live a quiet, steady life.

701
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,359
You really are a reckless fool.

702
00:33:06,079 --> 00:33:08,200
Do you even understand
what His Highness's name carries?

703
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,720
Think carefully.

704
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,640
If you miss this chance,

705
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:12,960
you may regret it for life.

706
00:33:13,079 --> 00:33:14,519
What a pity that would be.

707
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:15,640
Join the garrison,

708
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:17,319
and you'll have horses and firearms,

709
00:33:17,599 --> 00:33:19,039
and many chances to hone your skills.

710
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,519
How could you not want that?

711
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,160
You have three days.

712
00:33:28,319 --> 00:33:29,759
Think it over, and give me your answer.

713
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:32,720
Zhao.

714
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:36,680
Zhao.

715
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,400
His Highness
is steadily gaining strength.

716
00:33:38,799 --> 00:33:41,279
One day, he will surely become
a wise and virtuous ruler.

717
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:42,480
You're the first man

718
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,359
of the martial world
he's personally sought to recruit.

719
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:45,599
Think very carefully.

720
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:46,680
Yes.

721
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,759
Thank you for the advice.

722
00:33:49,359 --> 00:33:50,279
But I've made up my mind.

723
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:51,480
No need to persuade me further.

724
00:33:52,279 --> 00:33:53,200
When we cross paths again,

725
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,440
we'll have a chance to spar.

726
00:34:04,839 --> 00:34:05,960
Do you understand now?

727
00:34:06,279 --> 00:34:07,319
His Highness

728
00:34:07,319 --> 00:34:09,679
may seem to have given Zhao Ling
three days,

729
00:34:09,679 --> 00:34:12,239
but those three days are really for you.

730
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:13,840
You'd better think of something

731
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:14,559
and help His Highness

732
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:16,280
keep such a valuable man.

733
00:34:29,039 --> 00:34:30,159
What's all this about?

734
00:34:30,719 --> 00:34:31,480
Mr. Zhao.

735
00:34:32,039 --> 00:34:33,360
I need to go home.

736
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:35,639
My mother sent word
that she hasn't been well.

737
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:36,840
Same here.

738
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:38,440
I've been away for years.

739
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:39,480
It's time I went home too.

740
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:42,960
You should.

741
00:34:45,079 --> 00:34:45,920
Safe travels.

742
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:53,559
We're off, Mr. Zhao.

743
00:34:53,559 --> 00:34:54,119
Go on.

744
00:34:58,239 --> 00:34:58,679
Let's go.

745
00:35:14,719 --> 00:35:15,559
Mr. Zhao.

746
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:34,400
In a few days,

747
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:36,800
I'm leaving too.

748
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:39,880
After that,

749
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:42,840
our paths will part.

750
00:35:53,079 --> 00:35:53,800
Take care.

751
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,159
Take care.

752
00:36:01,640 --> 00:36:05,520
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye♪

753
00:36:05,520 --> 00:36:09,800
♪Will fill my eyes with tears♪

754
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:12,760
♪Etched deep within my heart♪

755
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:17,120
♪Yet buried without a word♪

756
00:36:17,120 --> 00:36:21,240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

757
00:36:21,240 --> 00:36:25,880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

758
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:30,600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

759
00:36:54,159 --> 00:36:55,880
Though this matter
could have been kept quiet,

760
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,719
I could not ease my conscience,

761
00:36:57,719 --> 00:36:58,679
so I came to confess.

762
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:01,000
My foolish daughter-in-law

763
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:02,800
nearly jeopardized an important matter.

764
00:37:03,199 --> 00:37:04,719
Even death would not be enough.

765
00:37:05,079 --> 00:37:07,320
I beg Your Highness
to forgive her youthful recklessness.

766
00:37:07,559 --> 00:37:08,519
When I return home,

767
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,760
I will discipline her strictly.

768
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:13,920
I warned you long ago, Madam.

769
00:37:14,159 --> 00:37:15,440
When the true scripture
is finally obtained,

770
00:37:15,559 --> 00:37:16,920
you too may ascend the lotus throne.

771
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:21,199
I failed to keep my household

772
00:37:21,199 --> 00:37:22,159
in order.

773
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:24,159
I ask Your Highness to punish me.

774
00:37:29,239 --> 00:37:30,679
Rise, Madam Yu.

775
00:37:37,719 --> 00:37:38,840
Lord Yu

776
00:37:40,079 --> 00:37:41,639
is one of His Majesty's
most trusted ministers.

777
00:37:42,719 --> 00:37:44,239
Though you were careless,

778
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:46,039
I won't be too harsh.

779
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:48,840
But as for the salt administration,

780
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,599
there can be no reward
for your contribution.

781
00:37:57,159 --> 00:37:58,559
It is the Yu family's duty

782
00:37:59,599 --> 00:38:01,360
to ease Your Highness's burdens.

783
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:04,280
I would never dare claim credit.

784
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,639
I shall take my leave.

785
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:22,480
The most important thing
still isn't settled.

786
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,360
If I'm going to marry,

787
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,000
I'll make sure it's a grand affair.

788
00:38:27,639 --> 00:38:28,880
In three or five years,

789
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,400
once my life is secure,

790
00:38:31,159 --> 00:38:32,039
all anyone will remember

791
00:38:32,039 --> 00:38:33,400
is that I'm the eldest young madam
of the Yu family.

792
00:38:34,079 --> 00:38:35,679
Who will remember
today's humiliation then?

793
00:38:36,719 --> 00:38:38,400
If I lose my nerve now,

794
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,000
then I'm truly finished.

795
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:43,559
Bring me the dowry list.

796
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:58,400
How can this be?

797
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:01,800
I can overlook the cabinets
not being made of expensive wood,

798
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:02,719
but this vanity box...

799
00:39:03,199 --> 00:39:05,239
I'll use it every single day.

800
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,239
How can it not be made
of huanghuali wood?

801
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:09,480
People will laugh at me.

802
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,840
Miss Fan,

803
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,679
a single huanghuali vanity box

804
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:14,960
costs at least a hundred taels
of silver.

805
00:39:15,639 --> 00:39:17,400
The more people look down on me,

806
00:39:18,079 --> 00:39:19,639
the more I have to keep up appearances.

807
00:39:20,559 --> 00:39:21,599
If we don't have enough silver,

808
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:23,960
sell three more chests of manuscripts.

809
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:30,960
(Next Episode)

810
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,960
(It's never easy for a woman
to make her own way.)

811
00:39:34,599 --> 00:39:36,960
(If I must find one tree strong enough
to shelter me,)

812
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:38,559
(you're the one I trust most.)

813
00:39:39,239 --> 00:39:40,599
Perhaps in this world,

814
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:41,840
the strongest alliances are forged

815
00:39:42,320 --> 00:39:44,599
when sincere hearts
yield mutual benefit,

816
00:39:45,079 --> 00:39:46,199
and that benefit

817
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,719
ripens into genuine affection.

818
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,360
Bound by shared interests,

819
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:51,239
we may rely on each other fully.

820
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,480
Mr. Zhao, will you marry me?

821
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:54,880
For you,

822
00:39:56,719 --> 00:39:57,760
marriage

823
00:40:01,079 --> 00:40:02,679
is nothing but a bond of interests

824
00:40:02,679 --> 00:40:03,800
and a path to advance your standing?

825
00:40:16,321 --> 00:40:20,641
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

826
00:40:24,241 --> 00:40:28,601
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

827
00:40:30,721 --> 00:40:35,361
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

828
00:40:35,601 --> 00:40:38,401
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

829
00:40:39,561 --> 00:40:44,201
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

830
00:40:47,401 --> 00:40:54,241
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

831
00:40:55,121 --> 00:41:01,641
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

832
00:41:02,601 --> 00:41:06,041
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

833
00:41:06,561 --> 00:41:10,761
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

834
00:41:11,041 --> 00:41:16,721
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

835
00:41:28,841 --> 00:41:32,721
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

836
00:41:36,641 --> 00:41:40,641
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

837
00:41:42,361 --> 00:41:47,041
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

838
00:41:47,361 --> 00:41:50,041
♪Kept close within my heart♪

839
00:41:51,121 --> 00:41:55,961
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

840
00:41:59,481 --> 00:42:06,401
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

841
00:42:07,281 --> 00:42:13,761
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

842
00:42:14,641 --> 00:42:18,161
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

843
00:42:18,601 --> 00:42:22,961
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

844
00:42:23,161 --> 00:42:28,881
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
